      "name": "record-decision-rationale",
      "title": "Record a decision rationale (optional)",
      "description": "OPTIONAL and never blocking: a health worker who chooses to may note why they accepted or declined decision-support guidance, in one tap plus an optional coded or free-text reason. Input is the decision; output is one FHIR Provenance (or nothing, when skipped, which is the default). The care plan is updated whether or not this is ever done.",
